{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01CqVrsJcqkuFCrJqXgHN5Pq", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_(fireboat)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fireboats_of_Chicago\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Medill_(1908)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/sn95069780/1908-08-13/ed-1/seq-7/ocr\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/2010270500/1908-08-06/ed-1/seq-8.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.everygoddamnday.com/2015/07/chicago-fire-week-2-floating-firehouse.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://shotlinediving.com/wreck/fountain-city/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://fsi.illinois.edu/content/library/IFLODD/search/firefighter_detail.cfm?ff_id=1749\"}, {\"url\": \"https://encyclopedia.chicagohistory.org/pages/10533.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/sn95069780/1908-08-13/ed-1/seq-7/ocr)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/2010270500/1908-08-06/ed-1/seq-8.pdf).)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_(fireboat)))\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fireboats_of_Chicago))\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:59:16.778Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Chicago Fire Department fireboat sank 1908 refloated", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_019Q7fcMLw8XrynzhMJvf8HW", "content": [{"title": "Illinois (fireboat)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_(fireboat)"}, {"title": "Fireboats of Chicago", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fireboats_of_Chicago"}, {"title": "Joseph Medill (1908)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Medill_(1908)"}, {"title": "Valentine Democrat. (Valentine, Neb.) 1900-1930, August 13, 1908, Image 7", "url": "https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/sn95069780/1908-08-13/ed-1/seq-7/ocr"}, {"title": "seq 8", "url": "https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/2010270500/1908-08-06/ed-1/seq-8.pdf"}, {"title": "chicago fire week 2 floating firehouse", "url": "https://www.everygoddamnday.com/2015/07/chicago-fire-week-2-floating-firehouse.html"}, {"title": "Shotline Diving Wreck Profile", "url": "https://shotlinediving.com/wreck/fountain-city/"}, {"title": "Name | John Meyers |", "url": "https://fsi.illinois.edu/content/library/IFLODD/search/firefighter_detail.cfm?ff_id=1749"}, {"title": "Encyclopedia o f Chicago", "url": "https://encyclopedia.chicagohistory.org/pages/10533.html"}]}, "The search turned up consistent accounts of the 1908 incident, with a few discrepancies in the background details.\n\n- **The sinking:** A 1908 grain elevator fire at the Chicago, Burlington & Quincy docks at 10th Street spread to the fireboat Illinois. A 1908 newspaper report says the collapse of an elevator wall sent the boat to the bottom of the river, injuring several firemen but leaving no one killed. (Sources: [nebnewspapers.unl.edu, Aug. 13, 1908](https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/sn95069780/1908-08-13/ed-1/seq-7/ocr) and [nebnewspapers.unl.edu, Aug. 6, 1908](https://nebnewspapers.unl.edu/lccn/2010270500/1908-08-06/ed-1/seq-8.pdf).)\n- **Depth and refloating:** Wikipedia says the boat sank in about 20 feet of water in the Chicago River and was quickly raised and returned to service. ([Illinois (fireboat)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Illinois_(fireboat))). The fleet-history table on the Fireboats of Chicago page gives the same account. ([Fireboats of Chicago](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fireboats_of_Chicago))\n- **Discrepancies:** The Wikipedia Illinois article gives a commissioning date of 1888, while the Fireboats of Chicago table lists 1899. The Illinois's name is also given variously in the sources, so the dates should be checked against a primary source before relying on them.\n\nI found no independent confirmation of the refloating beyond these Wikipedia pages, so the detail about how quickly it was raised rests on that source alone."], "durationSeconds": 6.444420582999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01CqVrsJcqkuFCrJqXgHN5Pq", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
